      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُرْمُودٌ</span></b>  The <i>male mountain-goat:</i> (L, K:) or <i>a
mountain-kid:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرَامِيدُ</span>, (AO, Az, S, L,) with
which <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرَاهِيدُ</span> is syn. (Az, L) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  The <i>fruit of the</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَضَاة</span>: (L, K:) or <i>a species thereof;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُرْمُوطٌ</span>.
(T, L.)

